1
00:00:00,242 --> 00:00:01,472
So nice to meet you.

2
00:00:01,477 --> 00:00:03,647
(Mrs Cooper:)Nice to meet you, too.
How was your flight?

3
00:00:03,646 --> 00:00:05,316
(Dr Hofstadter:)Very pleasant. And yours?

4
00:00:05,314 --> 00:00:07,144
(Mrs Cooper:)Lovely. Almost
as if someone--

5
00:00:07,149 --> 00:00:09,819
(Mrs Cooper:)not saying who-- was
watching over the plane.

6
00:00:12,387 --> 00:00:14,287
(Dr Hofstadter:)You're kidding, right?

7
00:00:15,456 --> 00:00:18,656
(Leonard:)Subtle, Mom,
real subtle.

8
00:00:24,932 --> 00:00:25,732
(Bernadette:)Stuart.

9
00:00:25,734 --> 00:00:29,274
(Leonard:)Morning.

10
00:00:29,271 --> 00:00:31,001
(Bernadette:)We talked about this.

11
00:00:31,006 --> 00:00:32,176
(Bernadette:)I don't mind you
still living here,

12
00:00:32,174 --> 00:00:33,744
(Bernadette:)but we got to have
some rules.

13
00:00:33,742 --> 00:00:35,872
(Bernadette:)And rule number one is pants.

14
00:00:38,413 --> 00:00:40,643
Hey, hey.
(clears throat)

15
00:00:44,319 --> 00:00:46,189
(Mrs Cooper:)You must be very
proud of your son.

16
00:00:46,188 --> 00:00:47,358
(Dr Hofstadter:)Oh, yes.

17
00:00:47,356 --> 00:00:51,226
(Dr Hofstadter:)He recently argued a case
before the Supreme Court.

18
00:00:53,194 --> 00:00:55,094
(Mrs Cooper:)He did?

19
00:00:56,097 --> 00:00:59,097
(Dr Hofstadter:)Oh, you mean this son.

